'''Extrusions de l'Istme, S.A.''' ({{lang|ca|Extrusions de l'Istme}}) is a Balboan aluminium extrusions manufacturer, producing profiles, structural components, and tubes from primary aluminium supplied by [[Alumini de Balboa]] and [[Metalls del Yalabirga]]. Founded in 1985 as the final downstream component of the domestic processing chain, the company operates extrusion presses at [[Sant Bart]] in [[Jala Province|Jala]]. The company's products supply the construction sector (window frames, door frames, structural profiles), the transportation industry, and the assembly sector, where domestic aluminium components reduce dependence on imported parts from [[Sinchew]] and [[Tapuya]].

The company is listed on the [[Bolsa de Sant Cristòfor]] under the ticker EXI. The [[Balboa Pension Fund]] holds a 4 per cent stake.

